    "title": "Westgate, Lafayette Renaissance square off for district championship - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Eric Narcisse ,\n1 days ago\nIn its first two full seasons as members of the LHSAA, Lafayette Renaissance’s football program has accomplished several feats. During that time, the Tigers have won 16 games, posted back-to-back winning seasons, qualified for the playoffs in both years and recorded the school first playoff victory last season on their way to the Division III select quarterfinals.\nRead full article\n2",
